o management?  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A classic pixel-art aesthetic and bumpin' soundtrack brings the world of Puzzle Depot to life!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each sprawling level is jam-packed with puzzling rooms, optional goals, and secrets to find.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploit dangerous fauna to help solve puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Collect useful tools to improve your puzzle solving capabilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undo moves, restart rooms, replay levels, and save your game anywhere you like. Convenient!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as several characters with unique abilities for tackling the Depot's many challenges. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Discover deep lore and bad jokes through various notes, datalogs, and dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Create and share your own nefarious puzzles with a fully-featured level editor!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100% created by real-life human beings!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Laughing Manatee Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108190/2d70ff7c86e2632ebe4ee8c0fc8e931c1aeba05f/header.jpg?t=1768532776","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Puzzle Depot (C) Laughing Manatee Games LLC","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3108190/1148147453/2ec37063e1cc63669ae49bb13acdfbf4398a5960/1762326442/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762327140","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.c